# Source assets are kept locally; optimized derivatives are generated into public/
# and committed. Uncomment if you'd rather generate them on CI instead.
# public/work/
# public/riyaz/

# Reference captures of other designers' live sites, kept for local research.
# Not ours to publish, and 47MB that git history would hold onto forever.
Inspirarion/

# CareerLogica source exports — 37MB of PNGs that only exist to be fed through
# `npm run images`. The optimized derivatives in public/work/careerlogica/ are
# committed and are what the site serves; these are the negatives, not the
# prints. Back them up outside the repo — regenerating at a different size
# needs them, and git history is the wrong place to keep 37MB forever.
CareerLogica Images/

# Local-only agent permissions. launch.json is shared on purpose (it is how the
# dev server gets started); this one is per-machine.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Screenshots taken while checking layouts. Scratch, not deliverables — they
# land at the repo root and would otherwise get swept up by `git add -A`.
/home-*.png
/case-*.png

# Snapshots and console logs written by the Playwright MCP browser.
.playwright-mcp/

# Screen recordings made while reproducing a bug. Useful locally, but they are
# tens of megabytes each and git would keep them forever.
Scroll Issue Video/
*.mp4
